  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Fish Export Industry in Bangladesh is becoming more and more important for the country&#x2019;s economy resulting in growing demand for investments. Through K&#xf8;lemadsen&#x2019;s previous and current market involvement, they have been able to secure an acceptable market position with potential for further development. Therefore, they have decided to engage in a new market strategy regarding Bangladesh exploring the possibilities for a more permanent establishment on the market in form of a service workshop.</narrative>
  </description>
